{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Html/Spec.html#Lean.Html.isVoidElement\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Html</span>.<span class=\"name\">isVoidElement</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">tagName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Whether `tagName` \\(compared case-insensitively\\) names a void element.\n\nVoid elements are those that cannot have any child nodes.\nThese only have a start tag; end tags must not be specified.\nSee https://html.spec.whatwg.org/dev/syntax.html\\#void-elements. ","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Html/Spec.html#Lean.Html.isVoidElement","kind":"def","line":48,"name":"Lean.Html.isVoidElement","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Data/Html/Spec.lean#L48-L54"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Html/Spec.html#Lean.Html.isNonCharacter\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Html</span>.<span class=\"name\">isNonCharacter</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Char\">Char</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Whether `c` is a [noncharacter](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#noncharacter). ","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Html/Spec.html#Lean.Html.isNonCharacter","kind":"def","line":32,"name":"Lean.Html.isNonCharacter","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e